HRN Dokan Hisab — Online APK Build ZIP

This is an Android SOURCE project, not an APK. It includes a GitHub Actions workflow to build the APK online.

Contents:
- Android WebView app source
- Offline HTML interface at app/src/main/assets/index.html
- Logo at app/src/main/assets/logo.png
- GitHub Actions workflow at .github/workflows/build-apk.yml
- No Firebase and no INTERNET permission in the app manifest

ONLINE BUILD STEPS (GitHub):
1. Sign in or create a GitHub account.
2. Create a NEW repository. Keep it private if you prefer.
3. Extract this ZIP on your phone or computer.
4. Upload the CONTENTS of this folder to the repository root (do not upload the outer folder itself).
   The root must show settings.gradle, build.gradle, app/, and .github/.
5. Open the repository's Actions tab.
6. Select "Build HRN Dokan Hisab APK" workflow and tap "Run workflow" (or push to main).
7. Wait for the workflow to finish successfully.
8. Open the completed workflow run, scroll to Artifacts, and download HRN-Dokan-Hisab-debug-apk.
9. Extract the artifact ZIP. Inside it will be app-debug.apk. Install it on your Android phone.

Important:
- The first online build can take several minutes.
- This is a debug APK for testing, not a Play Store release-signed APK.
- Do not share GitHub passwords or private tokens with anyone.
- The APK is not built yet; this ZIP contains source and an online build workflow.
